torical copy and multiplicity archived. The original strict-count\n  failure remains visible; no cost reset or gate waiver is claimed.\n\n### Testing\n- Focused Lean checks, six signature/standard-axiom diagnostics, zero-error\n  specialization, blueprint web/sync and all 1641 declaration links passed.\n- Normal hooks and pending/committed merge-loss guards passed. Exact unique\n  content and incoming chapter reconstruction were checked byte-for-byte.\n- Fresh exact-head CI, rooted compiled audit and independent review are required\n  after publication and retargeting. Old CI or reviews do not approve this head.\n\n---\nCloses #429\n"}
